# SOC Team Internals

## Overview

This module focuses on the internal operations of a Security Operations Center (SOC) and the essential skills required for a Level 1 SOC Analyst.

## Topics Covered

- Alert Triage and Classification
- Alert Reporting
- Escalation and Communication
- SOC Workbooks and Lookups
- SOC Metrics and Objectives
- SOC Simulator Practice

## Key Takeaway

Understanding SOC workflows helps analysts efficiently investigate, document, escalate, and communicate security alerts.
